      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For Sign up Page\nCreate a \"user\" database into the system on signup\nCheck creds as follows \n1. Login Id Should be unique and must be in between 6-12 characters.\n2. Email Id should not be a duplicate in database\n3. password must be unique and must contain a small case, a large case \nand a special character and length should be more than 8 characters\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For Sign up Page\nCreate a \"user\" database into the system on signup\nCheck creds as follows \n1. Login Id Should be unique and must be in between 6-12 characters.\n2. Email Id should not be a duplicate in database\n3. password must be unique and must contain a small case, a large case \nand a special character and length should be more than 8 characters\n",
